(label "V5C" (at 238.76 391.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7973bf98-2e3c-587d-aed8-58a1f308f556"))
(text "jank LCD-2 add-on (worktrees/lcd2-addon-scratch). The Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 plugs into J15 (its P1) / J16 (its P2): +3V3, VBAT, VBUS_B (its USB-C VBUS) and 14 GPIOs (parts.GPIO)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "135c6978-35b5-53f9-a832-076968f41a77"))
(text "5 V aux: VIN_B from VBUS_B through D3, or from VBAT through Q1 (off while VBUS_B is up); U18 TPS61023 -> V5A 4.79 V (R134 / R135+R154+R136); U19 clamp 5.56 V behind R145; JP8 MIDI, JP9 CV." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.509999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1c046fc2-d2ac-5706-8ae9-59e0c4d94ce8"))
(text "USB: J1 IN (USB-C, the outside loop cable from the LCD-2's own USB-C; VBUS / CC open) -> D+ / D- -> J4 OUT (USB-A), U5 ESD; J4's VBUS = the host signal (HOST5 from U21, R93, D16) + C28." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "18f5ac0c-98eb-5e89-bc77-8f5f9c8deba9"))
